    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "She wishes she could be heroic, but once more she can’t",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2817
        }
      ],
      "words": 11
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "This boy, who is at least ten years younger than her, is raping her. That is all there is to say",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5999
        }
      ],
      "words": 21
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "And something snaps. The world has gone crazy, not her. She is not broken, she is very much herself; and what she is, is",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6998
        }
      ],
      "words": 25
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Covered in bruises and blood, but without having shed a single tear, Angela is sprawled on the floor",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7546
        }
      ],
      "words": 18
    },
    {
      "block": "原句9",
      "no": 9,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Green, blinding light. A light that is music at the same time, each ray becoming a note, each note becoming a caress",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 8646
        }
      ],
      "words": 22
    },
    {
      "block": "原句10",
      "no": 10,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Reality or faith, reason or love. The oldest choice in the universe",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 11145
        }
      ],
      "words": 12
    },
    {
      "block": "原句11",
      "no": 11,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "It’s not in old papers that he has found his story: it’s all around him. Fatty Bolger was wrong. The Island exists",
